  "workflow_rules": [
    "Each discipline node declares inputs, outputs, units, configuration digest, applicability domain, fidelity and cost.",
    "An inactive discipline means not_assessed, never zero mass, zero drag, zero cost or implicit pass.",
    "A dynamic workflow may skip a high-cost analysis only when a conservative lower-fidelity result proves it cannot change the decision; otherwise return indeterminate or acquire evidence.",
    "All graph activation decisions, skipped analyses, failures and abstentions are retained in an immutable run receipt.",
    "Reuse issue owners #3900 for phase-resolved hybrid dispatch and #3903 for installed battery/capacitor evidence; do not fork those physical models."
  ],
